   "kind": "fact",
   "text": "The oldest known sentence written in an alphabet is on a tiny ivory comb. It says, \"May this tusk root out the lice of the hair and the beard.\"",
   "topic": "words and languages",
   "note": "The comb is roughly 3,700 years old, but radiocarbon dating failed and its exact date is uncertain. Earlier alphabet inscriptions only had single words or short letter groups.",
